      "absence_semantics_caveat": "A Friday designation that no longer appears in the ESPN summary feed is NOT evidence the player is active: ESPN drops players from the injury list once a designation lapses, and official inactives are published 90 minutes before kickoff, not inside the injury feed. Read stored_names_absent_detail as 'designation resolved or withdrawn, needs owner confirmation', never as 'cleared to play'.",
      "diff_caveat": "Stored side is the Friday v3.0 overlay's applied designations for these games. The T-90 ESPN pull is the full league designation list, so newly_listed names include players the Friday materiality filter never carried \u2014 scope difference, not all status flips. The signal that matters is stored_names_absent_from_refresh: curated Friday names no longer Out/Doubtful/Questionable at T-90. A newly-listed name on a sealed ticket is a flag for the owner, never a silent reprice."
    }
